[[Coalescence]] is a [[legendary trinket]] crafted in the [[Mystic Forge]]. The three [[Guild Wars 2: Path of Fire|Path of Fire]] [[raid]]s must be completed in order to craft this item.

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|They walked through the [[Underworld]], dove straight into the [[Mystic Forge]]. They crossed through the long-forgotten halls of [[The Key of Ahdashim|Ahdashim]]—such feats would be cast in gold and told to awe-struck children.}}

== Acquisition ==
=== Contained in ===
{{contained in}}

